#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# winoracle 2026-09-28, WARP ("Microsoft Basic Render Driver"), x64 above.
# The i686 build prints the same bytes except "pointer size 4".
# Nondeterminism seen on WARP (3 x64 runs): "End-only spin" on the SO_* types
# once returned needed=<garbage> (SO_STATISTICS_STREAM1) and once BOOL=1
# (SO_OVERFLOW_PREDICATE_STREAM3). The HRESULT (S_OK) was stable; the value of
# an End-without-Begin SO query is not reliable on WARP. The spec (D3D11.3
# 20.3.4) makes End alone equal to Begin+End, i.e. an empty range = zeros.
#
# Verdicts for Vitreo (build of 2026-09-27 23:22), full detail in
# .docs/audits/2026-09-28-d3d11-contract-audit/area-10-queries.md:
# [create]   WRONG: invalid Query / MiscFlags -> E_NOTIMPL (Windows E_INVALIDARG);
#            CreateQuery(OCCLUSION_PREDICATE / SO_OVERFLOW_PREDICATE / any
#            per-stream predicate) and PREDICATEHINT -> E_NOTIMPL (Windows S_OK,
#            object answers QI(ID3D11Predicate)); PIPELINE_STATISTICS E_NOTIMPL;
#            GetDataSize 0 for OCCLUSION/SO/predicates; per-stream SO enum
#            values misnumbered (9/11 treated as SO_STATISTICS_STREAM1/3,
#            12..15 as overflow predicates); CreatePredicate writes NULL into
#            ppPredicate where Windows leaves it untouched.
# [create1]  MISSING: ID3D11Query1 vtable has no slot 9 (GetDesc1 -> branch
#            to NULL); ContextType rule for PIPELINE_STATISTICS /
#            OCCLUSION_PREDICATE (only ALL/3D) absent.
# [getdata]  WRONG: never-issued / building -> S_FALSE (Windows
#            DXGI_ERROR_INVALID_CALL); End without Begin -> S_FALSE forever
#            (Windows S_OK, empty range); (buf,0) -> E_INVALIDARG (Windows
#            S_OK); TIMESTAMP(_DISJOINT) (NULL,0) -> E_INVALIDARG (Windows S_OK);
#            larger DataSize accepted (Windows E_INVALIDARG); undefined
#            GetDataFlags accepted (Windows E_INVALIDARG).
# [occlusion] FABRICATED: every count is 1 and every predicate TRUE.
# [pipeline] MISSING (CreateQuery E_NOTIMPL).
#            pstats pass (2026-09-28): every counter counted; the one line
#            left, "quad half off-screen" PSInvocations 1068 vs 1088, differs
#            in helper pixels only (equal occlusion, d3d11_pstats_probe).
# [timestamp] correct (Frequency 1e9 > 10 MHz; WARP itself reports 10 MHz).
# [so]       single-stream counts correct; Begin twice not a restart (3/3 vs
#            1/1); streams 2/3 and per-stream predicates unreachable; the
#            two-stream GS is E_NOTIMPL.
# [predication] FABRICATED: nothing is ever skipped (all 22 operations run
#            where Windows skips); SetPredication raises the public refcount.
#            (Vitreo's Dispatch / DispatchIndirect cells read back 0 at
#            random -- a separate readback-ordering defect, see
#            d3d11_a10_dispatch_readback_probe.)
# [counters] correct.  [null] CreatePredicate(NULL) writes NULL out (minor).
